## 13. Definition of done
- There is exactly one navigation (the sidebar with three items). No top bar exists, names are consistent everywhere, and Design System is reachable only via Settings or the direct URL.
- No screen shows the same action twice and no screen has more than one filled primary button. Native selects are gone.
- Studio has 3 steps per document, the preview stays on the right on every step, and the step's primary action lives only in the bottom bar.
- The Cover letter works end to end in demo mode and with a real Ollama. It is grounded, scored, exported (PDF, Markdown, Text, Copy as text), versioned, and visible in Applications.
- Generated bullets have no duplicated metrics and no lowercase-after-period, and the contact block never has dangling separators.
- No implementation vocabulary appears in the UI (banned-terms test passes). Monospace appears only for code, URLs and paths.
- `npm run check` passes with the hexagonal boundaries, the one-CSS-file rule and the no-inline-styles rule intact. Docs and screenshots are updated.